<title>UK: Corestates Capital sets $150 mln 30-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Corestates Capital sets $150 mln 30-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CORESTATES CAPITAL 2</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  CORESTATES BANK NA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JAN.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   * 80-82 BP  PAY DATE  S-23.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  *	   FULL FEES   0.875</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    *</p>
<p> NOTES    * TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
</text>
